This application bundles Apache Flink and Apache Pulsar components distributed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

BasePulsarSubscriber.java and MetadataListener.java are derived from the official
Apache Flink Pulsar Connector 4.2.0-1.20 sources published at Maven Central:
https://repo.maven.apache.org/maven2/org/apache/flink/flink-connector-pulsar/4.2.0-1.20/flink-connector-pulsar-4.2.0-1.20-sources.jar

Modification: metadata lookups call the Pulsar client 3.0.17 three-argument
getPartitionedTopicMetadata API, disabling metadata auto-creation and permitting
the legacy-broker fallback. Topics are explicitly bootstrapped before the job.
The two original binary classes and their inner classes are excluded from the
shaded dependency, and these sources are compiled against the pinned client.
Original Apache license headers are preserved. Remove this compatibility patch
when a released connector supports the updated client API directly.
